    "title": "JoCo Food Bank hosts \"Stuff the Truck\" Drive during Hunger Action Month - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Newsroom Staff ,\n16 hours ago GRANTS PASS, Ore. – If you’re in Grants Pass this weekend, there’s a great opportunity to give back to the community during Hunger Action Month. The Josephine County Food Bank is hosting the first of two “Stuff the Truck” food drives this Saturday from 10 a.m. to 2 p.m. at the Grocery Outlet, located at 350 NE Agnes Avenue. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
